                                "sense_id": "990c9c10-ad72-3e7c-b848-c37f2594354c",
                                "text": "Introduction to California Birdlife describes the representative birds in California's seven major bioregions: ocean, seashore, coastal ranges, Central Valley, mountains and foothills, Great Basin, and deserts."
                            }
                        ]
